WEBVTT

00:17:57.371 --> 00:18:00.788
and he was pretty hands on in terms
of helping to coach and mentor

00:18:00.788 --> 00:18:01.788
and all that stuff.

00:18:01.954 --> 00:18:04.413
Then he was offered his
first leadership job,

00:18:04.996 --> 00:18:10.954
and that is when I came to
appreciate my superpower,

00:18:11.538 --> 00:18:14.663
and that is motivating and
mobilizing talent.

00:18:15.038 --> 00:18:17.913
Mandela rose to become the head
of private wealth management,

00:18:18.288 --> 00:18:21.621
and now he's Morgan Stanley's chief
human resources officer.

00:18:22.204 --> 00:18:27.329
Thing that really comes to mind when I
think about why this firm was different.

00:18:27.454 --> 00:18:31.663
For me, it's really been the diversity
of experiences that I've been able to